<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Australian XI score 258 for eight.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Australian XI score 258 for eight.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Prime Minister's XI scored 258 for eight in 50 overs in their limited overs match against West Indies at Manuka Oval on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Score - Prime Minister's XI 258 for eight in 50 overs (Ian Harvey 55 not out, Dene Hills 52) v West Indies.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
